    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/6ee804c97b2fa9ed4287650a0bfe8ac7.poster.avif?t=1751534404\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/6ee804c97b2fa9ed4287650a0bfe8ac7.webm?t=1751534404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/a0628422781616fe34db73d166f46b8a.avif?t=1751534404\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meadgard</strong> is a mythological co-op management adventure. Grab a friend and let the chaos commence!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/f6ae89d982d2c2f3825e43ec4e60f22f.poster.avif?t=1751534404\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/f6ae89d982d2c2f3825e43ec4e60f22f.webp?t=1751534404\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unhappy vikings are sure to throw a tantrum. Do your best to keep up with their orders as you manage your very own tavern!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/d1ebb35392ac70b01a20f4c6aadd3d5f.poster.avif?t=1751534404\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/d1ebb35392ac70b01a20f4c6aadd3d5f.webp?t=1751534404\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the woods, defeat mythological beasts and gather resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/2b4695eafd5d335121568d52df741c57.poster.avif?t=1751534404\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/2b4695eafd5d335121568d52df741c57.webp?t=1751534404\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unique characters and invite them to your village. Craft weapons, brew potions - and unravel the stories and mysteries of your new neighbours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/6d22234e448928004a92fe2d0979b567.avif?t=1751534404\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/a0628422781616fe34db73d166f46b8a.avif?t=1751534404\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meadgard</strong> is a mythological co-op management adventure. Grab a friend and let the chaos commence!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/f6ae89d982d2c2f3825e43ec4e60f22f.poster.avif?t=1751534404\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/f6ae89d982d2c2f3825e43ec4e60f22f.webp?t=1751534404\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unhappy vikings are sure to throw a tantrum. Do your best to keep up with their orders as you manage your very own tavern!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/d1ebb35392ac70b01a20f4c6aadd3d5f.poster.avif?t=1751534404\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/d1ebb35392ac70b01a20f4c6aadd3d5f.webp?t=1751534404\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the woods, defeat mythological beasts and gather resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/2b4695eafd5d335121568d52df741c57.poster.avif?t=1751534404\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/2b4695eafd5d335121568d52df741c57.webp?t=1751534404\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unique characters and invite them to your village. Craft weapons, brew potions - and unravel the stories and mysteries of your new neighbours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433560/extras/6d22234e448928004a92fe2d0979b567.avif?t=1751534404\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Grab your friends and embark on a mythical quest to create the ultimate Viking tavern. Serve feisty customers, meet a unique cast of villagers, and battle creatures and enemies as you explore the island for rare ingredients. Team up, discover new recipes, and prove your worth to the gods!",
